      "writtenOn": "2019-06-17T23:16:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this is not something which only EC can probe, please consider hardcoding it in bios. Some of the criteria to decide where info should be located:\n\n- Is it going to change? Can it be hardcoded?\n- Does it need to be probed by AP or EC?\n- Is it needed by EC or AP or both?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "94c0f1508e62a87e4383be5a4748e384445f6dd2",
