        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T01:51:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then, we had better hardcode this in BIOS, kernel or device tree. Boards can be identified by OEM_ID, BOARD_VERSION, SKU_ID, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "5ee54aeb_6a466f4c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
