      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T19:42:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay.\nany reason for Keeping it in BIOS?\nI think it would be good if we keep the info in EC\n1. Kernel driver only has to depend on cros_ec_cmd*()\n2. Number of ports are requested from EC hence easy to maintain\n3. No dependency on Coreboot",
      "parentUuid": "a5a3b679_08657803",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 42
      },
