      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T21:18:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For example, the mapping from type-c port # to a physical location is hardcoded in model.yaml:\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/board-overlays.git/+/master/overlay-nami/chromeos-base/chromeos-config-bsp-nami/files/model.yaml#50\n\nFYI: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform2/+/1259322.",
      "parentUuid": "258e87db_9195fcc2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
