      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T22:24:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "thanks for the details. I am not familiar with yaml files.\nHow to access the this data from Kernel?\nif we add it in yaml file, is this info available by vboot to do OS loading from USB3/2 drive on USB-C connector (ctrl+u command)?",
