      "lineNbr": 17,
      "author": {
        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T23:13:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about soc/Kconfig in Depthcharge, then?\n\nhttps://github.com/coreboot/depthcharge/blob/master/src/drivers/soc/Kconfig\n\nYou can add something like:\n  config DRIVER_SOC_USBC0_TO_USB2\n  config DRIVER_SOC_USBC1_TO_USB2\n  config DRIVER_SOC_USBC0_TO_USB3\n  config DRIVER_SOC_USBC1_TO_USB3\n\nand define the mapping in your board/x/defconfig.",
      "parentUuid": "22db9f65_d9b16d7e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 42
      },
