      "writtenOn": "2019-06-19T14:16:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "EC_RES_UNAVAILABLE seems more appropriate for version 1 (also it was suggested by Aseda) as it is applicable only to boards with Intel virtual mux.\nWould you still want me to change it to 0xff and EC_RES_SUCCESS?",
