      "writtenOn": "2019-06-19T17:28:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should have a new separate command, which is enabled by CONFIG_INTEL_VIRTUAL_MUX. It doesn\u0027t make sense to hide Intel specific code behind command version. Otherwise, non-intel boards call EC_CMD_USB_PD_PORTS v.1 and would get EC_RES_UNAVAILABLE.",
      "parentUuid": "686cc4ba_4c146496",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5075,
